  "interpretationRules": [
    "Exact paired x2 equivalence is a hard gate before half-step results are interpreted.",
    "Odd scaled-domain values are diagnostic candidates only; no numerical or scale promotion is automatic.",
    "Primary conclusions come from TL2-TL6; TL7 validates maturation and TL8-TL9 are endpoint stress evidence.",
    "Internal H/X criticals are not simulated here and require cadence scaling/audit before any canonical x2 adoption.",
    "A useful half-step should occupy a meaningful intermediate outcome region across multiple legal targets, not merely relocate one threshold."
  ]
